     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi folks,<div>Just wanted to let everyone know the <a href=\"https://d-rug.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466146549000&amp;usg=AOvVaw31YYwaOTw1uEEn3x9EAUYV\">D-RUG website</a> is now updated with the screencast and slides from the <a href=\"https://d-rug.github.io/blog/2019/Ryan-Peek-using-aggiedown-for-dissertation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.github.io/blog/2019/Ryan-Peek-using-aggiedown-for-dissertation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466146549000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1W1UpKdbykuAyAu3waaUXL\">aggiedown talk</a> I gave earlier this week. I&#39;ve also <a href=\"https://github.com/ryanpeek/aggiedown\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ryanpeek/aggiedown&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466146549000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0F74HueHXkmYuN9-Uas113\">updated the package</a> and it&#39;s running on both OSX and Windows platforms last I checked (and should work for Linux as well), so if you are interested, give it a go.</div><div><br></div><div>See folks next week for our usual working session, 12-2pm at the DSI.</div><div><br></div><div>Adios,</div><div>Ryan</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-sp